2026-01-02 16:14:18,658 - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/openai/v1/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-d57eebfa-d90b-4263-95f7-d693cee01173', 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': '\n        You are an expert Resume ATS Scanner and Career Coach.\n        \n        Job Description:\n        About the job\nCo-Founder & Chief Brand Officer\nA Rare Opportunity for Visionary Brand Architects | \u20b920 Lakhs Investment\n\n\n\nAbout Emilio Beaufort\nEmilio Beaufort is redefining luxury in the hair extension industry. Operating globally from India through Emilio Cosmetics and Ormee by Emilio, we\'ve built our foundation on ethical sourcing, complete traceability, and silent luxury that speaks through quality, not logos.\nOur collections—premium raw hair extensions, bespoke bridal experiences, and exclusive corporate grooming solutions—serve discerning clients who understand that true luxury is felt, not flaunted. We\'ve proven our concept. Now we need a visionary to architect our brand\'s global future.\n\n\nThe Opportunity\nWe\'re seeking a Co-Founder & Chief Brand Officer—a strategic brand architect who will shape how the world perceives luxury hair extensions. This isn\'t a hired position; it\'s a founding partnership with significant equity, decision-making authority, and the mandate to build something iconic.\n\n\nYour Role & Impact\nBrand Strategy & Identity\n\nDefine EB\'s brand persona, voice, visual language, and positioning across all markets\nCraft the narrative that communicates our values: ethical luxury, cultural sophistication, transformative beauty\nEstablish brand guidelines ensuring consistency and excellence across every touchpoint\nPosition Emilio Beaufort as the aspirational choice in luxury hair extensions globally\n\n\nMarketing & Growth\n\nDevelop comprehensive marketing strategies spanning digital, social, and experiential channels\nLead content creation, campaigns, and brand activations that drive awareness and desire\nBuild partnerships with luxury publications, influencers, celebrity stylists, and cultural tastemakers\nDirect PR initiatives to secure coverage in Vogue, Harper\'s Bazaar, and prestige outlets\n\n\nCustomer Experience\n\nDesign the end-to-end luxury customer journey from discovery to advocacy\nOversee digital presence: website, e-commerce, social ecosystems, and brand environments\nCreate educational content that empowers clients and builds brand authority\nEstablish VIP engagement protocols and high-touch relationship standards\n\n\nStrategic Leadership\n\nCollaborate on product positioning, launches, and go-to-market strategies\nBuild and lead a world-class brand, marketing, and creative team\nRepresent EB at industry events and high-level partnerships\nPartner with founders on business strategy, company vision, and long-term planning\n\n\nInvestment & Equity\nInvestment Required: \u20b920 Lakhs\nReturn Potential: Direct participation in company growth, profit distributions, and exit opportunities (acquisition, IPO, strategic partnerships)\n\n\nWho You Are\nRequired Experience\n\n15+ years leading brand strategy for luxury beauty, fashion, or premium consumer brands\nProven track record building or scaling luxury brands with measurable success\nDeep expertise in brand positioning, creative direction, and luxury marketing\nEstablished network in luxury retail, beauty editorial, or influencer ecosystems\nExperience leading creative teams and managing high-impact campaigns\n\n\nStrategic Capabilities\n\nEntrepreneurial mindset with startup or brand transformation experience\nFinancial acumen including marketing ROI, budget management, and P&L understanding\nAbility to craft narratives that resonate emotionally with luxury consumers\nUnderstanding of direct-to-consumer models and digital luxury commerce\n\n\nPersonal Attributes\n\nVisionary creativity with uncompromising standards for excellence\nCultural sophistication and ability to navigate global markets\nCollaborative spirit valuing partnership and shared success\nAuthentic passion for transformative beauty experiences\nEntrepreneurial courage to take calculated risks\nMagnetic presence to represent the brand with credibility and charisma\n\n\nWhy Now? Why EB?\nMarket Opportunity: The global luxury hair extension market is projected to exceed $5 billion by 2028, with conscious consumers demanding exactly what EB delivers—transparency, quality, authenticity.\nAuthentic Differentiation: In an opaque industry, our ethical sourcing and education-first approach is genuinely revolutionary. We\'re not fabricating a story; we\'re living it.\nProven Foundation: We have product-market fit, loyal clientele, and operational excellence. We need a brand architect to scale us from respected to iconic, regional to global.\nCreative Freedom: Full autonomy to build the brand as you envision it. No corporate bureaucracy. Just the mandate to make EB unforgettable.\nLegacy Opportunity: Build wealth, shape culture, and create something enduring. This is Co-Founder equity and decision-making power.\n\n\nWhat Success Looks Like (3 Years)\nEB is the first name associated with luxury hair extensions globally\nFeatured in every major luxury publication; worn by influential cultural figures\nE-commerce experience rivals Hermès and Aesop in sophistication\n10x brand awareness growth in target markets with substantial revenue impact\nWorld-class brand team recognized across the luxury beauty industry\nSignificant company valuation growth positioning EB for strategic opportunities\n\n\nNext Steps\nWeek 1-2: Vision alignment conversations and cultural fit assessment\n Week 3-4: Strategic deep dive—market analysis, financials, your brand vision for EB\n Week 5-6: Transparent due diligence and partnership chemistry evaluation\n Week 7-8: Terms negotiation—equity, vesting, authority, responsibilities\n Week 9+: Launch and execution of your strategic brand 