2026-01-02 16:16:27,902 - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/openai/v1/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-40c86225-0b7f-4ded-b574-2a1d50387124', 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': '\n        You are an expert Resume ATS Scanner and Career Coach.\n        \n        Job Description:\n        About the job\nCo-Founder & Chief Brand Officer\nA Rare Opportunity for Visionary Brand Architects | \u20b920 Lakhs Investment\n\n\n\nAbout Emilio Beaufort\nEmilio Beaufort is redefining luxury in the hair extension industry. Operating globally from India through Emilio Cosmetics and Ormee by Emilio, we\'ve built our foundation on ethical sourcing, complete traceability, and silent luxury that speaks through quality, not logos.\nOur collections—premium raw hair extensions, bespoke bridal experiences, and exclusive corporate grooming solutions—serve discerning clients who understand that true luxury is felt, not flaunted. We\'ve proven our concept. Now we need a visionary to architect our brand\'s global future.\n\n\nThe Opportunity\nWe\'re seeking a Co-Founder & Chief Brand Officer—a strategic brand architect who will shape how the world perceives luxury hair extensions. This isn\'t a hired position; it\'s a founding partnership with significant equity, decision-making authority, and the mandate to build something iconic.\n\n\nYour Role & Impact\nBrand Strategy & Identity\n\nDefine EB\'s brand persona, voice, visual language, and positioning across all markets\nCraft the narrative that communicates our values: ethical luxury, cultural sophistication, transformative beauty\nEstablish brand guidelines ensuring consistency and excellence across every touchpoint\nPosition Emilio Beaufort as the aspirational choice in luxury hair extensions globally\n\n\nMarketing & Growth\n\nDevelop comprehensive marketing strategies spanning digital, social, and experiential channels\nLead content creation, campaigns, and brand activations that drive awareness and desire\nBuild partnerships with luxury publications, influencers, celebrity stylists, and cultural tastemakers\nDirect PR initiatives to secure coverage in Vogue, Harper\'s Bazaar, and prestige outlets\n\n\nCustomer Experience\n\nDesign the end-to-end luxury customer journey from discovery to advocacy\nOversee digital presence: website, e-commerce, social ecosystems, and brand environments\nCreate educational content that empowers clients and builds brand authority\nEstablish VIP engagement protocols and high-touch relationship standards\n\n\nStrategic Leadership\n\nCollaborate on product positioning, launches, and go-to-market strategies\nBuild and lead a world-class brand, marketing, and creative team\nRepresent EB at industry events and high-level partnerships\nPartner with founders on business strategy, company vision, and long-term planning\n\n\nInvestment & Equity\nInvestment Required: \u20b920 Lakhs\nReturn Potential: Direct participation in company growth, profit distributions, and exit opportunities (acquisition, IPO, strategic partnerships)\n\n\nWho You Are\nRequired Experience\n\n15+ years leading brand strategy for luxury beauty, fashion, or premium consumer brands\nProven track record building or scaling luxury brands with measurable success\nDeep expertise in brand positioning, creative direction, and luxury marketing\nEstablished network in luxury retail, beauty editorial, or influencer ecosystems\nExperience leading creative teams and managing high-impact campaigns\n\n\nStrategic Capabilities\n\nEntrepreneurial mindset with startup or brand transformation experience\nFinancial acumen including marketing ROI, budget management, and P&L understanding\nAbility to craft narratives that resonate emotionally with luxury consumers\nUnderstanding of direct-to-consumer models and digital luxury commerce\n\n\nPersonal Attributes\n\nVisionary creativity with uncompromising standards for excellence\nCultural sophistication and ability to navigate global markets\nCollaborative spirit valuing partnership and shared success\nAuthentic passion for transformative beauty experiences\nEntrepreneurial courage to take calculated risks\nMagnetic presence to represent the brand with credibility and charisma\n\n\nWhy Now? Why EB?\nMarket Opportunity: The global luxury hair extension market is projected to exceed $5 billion by 2028, with conscious consumers demanding exactly what EB delivers—transparency, quality, authenticity.\nAuthentic Differentiation: In an opaque industry, our ethical sourcing and education-first approach is genuinely revolutionary. We\'re not fabricating a story; we\'re living it.\nProven Foundation: We have product-market fit, loyal clientele, and operational excellence. We need a brand architect to scale us from respected to iconic, regional to global.\nCreative Freedom: Full autonomy to build the brand as you envision it. No corporate bureaucracy. Just the mandate to make EB unforgettable.\nLegacy Opportunity: Build wealth, shape culture, and create something enduring. This is Co-Founder equity and decision-making power.\n\n\nWhat Success Looks Like (3 Years)\nEB is the first name associated with luxury hair extensions globally\nFeatured in every major luxury publication; worn by influential cultural figures\nE-commerce experience rivals Hermès and Aesop in sophistication\n10x brand awareness growth in target markets with substantial revenue impact\nWorld-class brand team recognized across the luxury beauty industry\nSignificant company valuation growth positioning EB for strategic opportunities\n\n\nNext Steps\nWeek 1-2: Vision alignment conversations and cultural fit assessment\n Week 3-4: Strategic deep dive—market analysis, financials, your brand vision for EB\n Week 5-6: Transparent due diligence and partnership chemistry evaluation\n Week 7-8: Terms negotiation—equity, vesting, authority, responsibilities\n Week 9+: Launch and execution of your strategic brand roadmap\n\n\nBuild a Legacy with Us\nThe luxury brands we revere weren\'t built by committees—they were built by visionaries obsessed with craft and excellence. Emilio Beaufort has that foundation. We need you to transform our excellence into an icon.\nThis is your opportunity to build something that outlasts us all.\n\n\nIf you have the vision, expertise, and \u20b920 lakhs to invest in the future of luxury hair extensions, let\'s create history together.\n\n\n\nEmilio Beaufort – Where Luxury Meets Legacy\n\nReady to join us? Let\'s talk.\n        \n        Resume Content:\n        PAVAN HARESH\npaven026@gmail.com\xa0 • \xa0+1 214-430-6317\xa0 • \xa0Plano, TX, USA\xa0 • \xa0 https://linkedin.com/in/impavan/\nSUMMARY\nAI Strategy and Enterprise Transformation Leader with 12+ years of experience driving large-scale AI adoption, product\ninnovation, and measurable enterprise value across Healthcare, Retail, BFSI, and Energy verticals and cross industry functions\nsuch as F&A, HR, Procurement, legal, marketing, Supply Chain. Proven commercial and delivery track record generating $250M\n+ pipeline, closing $50M+ revenue, and enabling $1B+ in business impact through AI modernization, platform development,\nand GTM execution. Deep expertise in Generative AI, Agentic AI, RAG ecosystems, Conversational AI, Knowledge Intelligence,\nand enterprise AI platforms across Azure, AWS, and Google Cloud combining hands-on technical credibility with strong product\nleadership and C-Suite partnership. Recognized for building scalable AI platforms, establishing responsible AI governance in\nregulated environments, and leading cross-functional engineering, data, and product teams to deliver secure, compliant, and\nhigh-impact AI solutions at enterprise scale.\nEXPERIENCE\nWipro,  Senior Product Manager & Practice Partner\nNov 2023 - Present\nDirected AI strategy and GTM execution across Healthcare, Retail, Life Sciences, Telecom verticals using ML/DL, GenAI,\nAgentic AI, and knowledge intelligence platforms, driving ~$250M opportunity pipeline and ~$50M+ in closed revenue. Partnered\nwith C-Suite leadership to build enterprise AI modernization roadmaps spanning clinical operations, regulatory workflows,\nand automation programs, aligning technology investments to measurable business outcomes and scalable value realization.\nEstablished a large-scale AI Center of Excellence for a major U.S. healthcare payer leveraging GenAI, decision intelligence,\nand automated workflows, reducing manual reviews by ~40%, improving claim turnaround by 25–30%, and delivering $50M+\nannual cost efficiencies. Architected behavioral claims audit automation with Multi Agent System using Azure, Langchain stack\nacross 5M+ annual claims, enabling real-time fraud and compliance anomaly detection and reducing manual intervention while\nincreasing audit accuracy and operational assurance. Built an enterprise Agentic AI system and workflow orchestration POC on\nAzure/Autogen stack to automate plan build and onboarding processes, cutting configuration cycles by 60%. Designed GenAI\nSOP conversational agent on Azure to find accurate answers from relevant SOP clauses, enhancing Dental First pass and\nadjustments claims processor\'s efficiency by 30.\nWipro,  Product Manager\nFeb 2022 - Nov 2023\nOwned global product roadmap and delivery for AI-powered Knowledge Platforms built using Azure Cognitive Search (BM25 +\nSemantic + Hybrid Search), indexing 80M+ documents across 12TB of enterprise content and improving knowledge access and\ndecisioning for ENU client. Led agile delivery as Product Manager and Scrum Master, managing sprints, stakeholder priorities,\nand platform enhancements to ensure predictable delivery, product adoption, and measurable business outcomes. Oversaw\nenterprise migration from Apache Solr to Azure Cognitive Search, enhancing scalability, search results relevancy and accuracy,\nimproving search efficiency and operational resilience. Defined and executed responsible AI governance practices aligned to\nregulatory frameworks, ensuring secure, compliant, and risk-aware AI adoption. Advanced GTM execution for AI offerings in\nregulated industries, guiding customers from PoC to full enterprise rollout, driving tangible ROI and operational modernization.\nWipro,  Solution Architect\nAug 2019 - Feb 2022\nDesigned and implemented end-to-end architecture and delivery of Contact Center Transformation and Knowledge Intelligence\nplatforms on Azure, aligning technical solutions to business goals, scalability requirements, and security standards for\nManufacturing and Telecom clients in UK geo. Architected migration of Conversational AI platforms from IBM Cloud to Azure\nusing NLP frameworks and cloud re-engineering, improving reliability, performance, and cost efficiency with minimal downtime.\nCollaborated with business, vendor, and technical stakeholders to define architecture blueprints, delivery plans, and execution\ngovernance, ensuring program stability, stakeholder alignment, and successful deployment.\nUniphore,  Senior Software Engineer\nNov 2018 - Aug 2019\nBuilt advanced NLP and conversational AI solutions for healthcare client using deep learning (Bi-LSTM, entity extraction)\ndeployed in secure cloud environments, enabling automation, improved service quality, and operational efficiency. Led secure\ndeployment and lifecycle management of ML/DL models, ensuring reliability, compliance, and sustained performance.\nPlankton Solutions,  Senior Software Engineer\nJun 2016 - Nov 2018\nPAVAN HARESH - page 1 of 2\nDesigned and deployed enterprise chatbot and analytics platforms using AI/ML and AWS cloud infrastructure, enhancing\ncustomer experience and operational intelligence. Led presales engineering, client solution design, and analytics delivery,\nsupporting successful client adoption and market-aligned AI deployment.\nTech Mahindra,  Senior Project Engineer\nJan 2014 - Jun 2016\nDelivered enterprise automation solutions across QA, UI, and reporting for Fortune 500 clients using Python, Selenium, Appium\ntools, improving operational efficiency, stability, and risk governance.\nEDUCATION\nVisvesvaraya Technological University (VTU)\nBachelor of Engineering  •  Computer Science\nLICENSES & CERTIFICATIONS\nAgentic AI\nDeepLearning.AI  •  \nGenerative AI Engineer Associate\nDatabricks  •  \nGoogle Cloud GenAI Level 3\nWipro AI Academy  •  \nAI Product Management\nDuke University  •  \nProject Management\nGoogle  •  \nAzure AI Developer Associate\nMicrosoft  •  \nAzure AI Fundamentals\nMicrosoft  •  \nSKILLS\nAzure OpenAI \xa0 • \xa0 AWS Bedrock \xa0 • \xa0 Google Vertex AI \xa0 • \xa0 Databricks \xa0 • \xa0 Agentspace \xa0 • \xa0 LangChain \xa0 • \xa0 AutoGen \xa0 • \xa0 RAG\narchitectures \xa0 • \xa0 Multi-agent systems \xa0 • \xa0 MLOps (Azure ML, MLflow)\nPAVAN HARESH - page 2 of 2\n\n        \n        Analyze the resume against the JD. Provide a JSON response with the following structure:\n        {\n            "match_score": <int 0-100>,\n            "swot_analysis": {\n                "strengths": ["list of strings"],\n                "weaknesses": ["list of strings"],\n                "opportunities": ["list of strings"],\n                "threats": ["list of strings"]\n            },\n            "recommendations": [\n                {\n                    "original": "<exact sentence from resume>",\n                    "suggested": "<rewritten sentence optimized for ATS and impact>",\n                    "reason": "<brief explanation>"\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n        Return ONLY valid JSON. Do not add markdown formatting like ```json.\n        '}], 'model': 'llama-3.3-70b-versatile', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_object'}, 'temperature': 0.0}}
