2026-01-14 19:20:18,720 - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/openai/v1/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-79aeaf04-9509-4755-828b-b80775068102', 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': '\n        You are an expert Resume ATS Scanner and Career Coach. I want you to step-by-step analyze the resume against the job description to provide the most accurate optimization.\n\n        ### STEP-BY-STEP REASONING PROCESS:\n        1. **Analyze the JD**: First, identify the core hard skills, soft skills, and domain-specific tools required.\n        2. **Analyze the Resume**: Look for where these skills appear or are missing in the resume. Note any weak or generic language.\n        3. **Gap Analysis**: Compare the two. Where is the candidate strong? Where are the fatal flaws (missing keywords)? What specific metrics could be inferred or suggested to improve credibility?\n        4. **Formulate Recommendations**: For every weak point identified, draft a rewrite that strictly mimics the high-impact style of top-tier resumes (Action Verb + Task + Result/Metric).\n        5. **Final Output Generation**: Structure your findings into the requested JSON format.\n\n        ### INPUT DATA:\n        Job Description:\n        About the job\nJob Title: Head of Artificial Intelligence\nCompany: Remidio Innovative Solutions Pvt. Ltd.\nLocation: Peenya, Bangalore (Full-time, Work from Office)\nReporting to: Chief Medical Officer\nExperience Level: 10+ years (8+ years strongly preferred)\nEducation: Master’s or PhD in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Mathematics, or a closely related field\n\n\nAbout Remidio\n\nRemidio is a fast-growing, global medtech innovator on a mission to prevent blindness through accessible, high-quality eye care. Our portable, FDA-cleared and CE-marked retinal imaging devices — powered by offline/edge AI — have already screened over 16 million patients across 55+ countries. We are revolutionizing population-scale screening for diabetic retinopathy, retinopathy of prematurity (ROP), glaucoma, AMD, and other blinding conditions by delivering intelligent, point-of-care diagnostics that are simple, affordable, and inclusive.\n\n\nWe are seeking a visionary, hands-on Head of Artificial Intelligence to own and accelerate our AI strategy, delivering clinically validated, regulatorily compliant innovations that transform global eye health and earn deep physician trust.\n\n\nRole Overview\n\n\n\nAs Head of Artificial Intelligence, you will be the strategic and technical leader for Remidio’s entire AI function. You will have end-to-end ownership of the AI vision, multi-year roadmap, model development, clinical validation, regulatory compliance, and worldwide scalability.\nThis is a high-impact, hands-on leadership role requiring deep expertise in medical computer vision, tight collaboration with clinical, regulatory, product, engineering, and founder teams, and the ability to ship production-grade AI that meets the highest global healthcare standards (FDA, CE, EU AI Act, etc.).\n\n\nYour leadership will directly shape the future of intelligent ophthalmic diagnostics and help Remidio reach millions more patients in underserved communities around the world.\n\n\nKey Responsibilities\n\n\n\n1. AI Strategy & Vision\n\n• Define and own Remidio’s long-term AI vision, multi-year roadmap, and technical strategy — aligned with clinical priorities, product goals, and business growth\n• Identify and integrate cutting-edge AI advancements (foundation models, multimodal AI, edge-optimized inference, etc.) into our portable retinal imaging ecosystem\n• Stay ahead of industry trends and convert emerging technologies into compliant, scalable, market-leading features\n2. End-to-End AI Development & Execution\n\n• Lead the full AI/ML lifecycle: data strategy & acquisition, model design, training, validation, deployment, monitoring, and lifecycle management